        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The orbs from the Siccabyssium Pool linger at the end of their path and move again when a new orb arrives. A creature can take damage only once, even if multiple orbs pass through its space. They don't impede movement and can stay in a creature’s space. Lethallica’s Metalligrasp also functions from the orbs’ spaces.</p><p>Orbs automatically fail all saves, have object immunities, immunity to critical hits and precision damage, and don’t trigger reactions by Flying. They ignore the difficult terrain from Flying upward.</p><p>If the pool is disabled, the orbs disappear.</p><p>There can only be a maximum of 4 orbs out at a time.</p>"
        },
