      "resistances": [],
      "stealth": {
        "details": "<p>For APL 10, set the AC to 26 and reduce the saves by 2.</p><p>For APL 12, set the AC to 29, increase the saves by 1, and increase the Hardness <em>to</em> 21.</p><p>Make sure to use the dropdown above to adjust the rest of the sheet.</p>",
        "value": -5
      }
    },
    "details": {
      "description": "<p>A pool is filled with liquid <strong>siccatite</strong> and <strong>abysium</strong> agitated by the Maw's influence, with a control panel next to it. It doesn't hinder movement.</p><p>This pool is <strong>not</strong> automatically destroyed by effects such as <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.r7ihOgKv19eJQnik]{Disintegrate}</em> and is instead affected as if it was a creature.</p><hr /><p>While adjacent to this pool, players gain the @UUID[Compendium.covalon.fey-courts-items.Item.tBc6dWmVXcJUjX8p]{Sky Coating} action, even if it's disabled or destroyed.</p><hr /><p>A creature other than Lethallica that enters the pool gains weakness 10 to cold and fire damage for 3 rounds and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.covalon.fey-courts-items.Item.K4g5yTIf9uKk6oXL]{Effect: Siccatite Weakness (T4)}</p><p>Once fully disabled or destroyed this pool can be traversed safely, and it can't be used for Lethallica's Metalligrasp.</p>",
      "disable": "<p>Arcana, Crafting, Nature, Thievery or <em>dispel magic</em>. A total of two successes are required to disable it. <br>A thieves's toolkit is required for Thievery, and either a thieves's toolkit or a repair toolkit is required for Crafting.<br>@Check[arcana|dc:27|traits:action:disable-a-device] @Check[nature|dc:27|traits:action:disable-a-device] @Check[thievery|dc:28|traits:action:disable-a-device] @Check[crafting|dc:29|traits:action:disable-a-device]</p><p>The counteract DC for <em>dispel magic </em>is <strong>#DC#</strong> and the Pool's counteract rank is <strong>APL/2 rounded up</strong>. A successful counteract counts as one successful disable, unless the counteract check was a critical success in which case it fully disables the Pool.</p>",
      "isComplex": true,
      "level": {
        "value": 14
      },
      "publication": {
        "authors": "",
        "license": "ORC",
        "remaster": false,
        "title": ""
      },
      "reset": "",
      "routine": "<p>(1 action) An orb of metal Flies from the Pool up to 60 feet in any path before dissolving. Creatures it passes through (except Lethallica) take @Damage[(2d8+4)[cold],(2d8+4)[fire]]{2d8+4 cold and 2d8+4 fire damage} with a @Check[reflex|dc:30|basic|traits:metal,magical] save. This is a magical and metal effect. On a failure a creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}; this is a poison effect.</p><p>The orb ignores difficult terrain from Flying upward and doesn't trigger reactions by Flying.</p>"
    },
